        "created_at": "2026-08-02T17:13:02.986Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’ve been building <strong>EVE Horizon</strong>, a web app for players managing manufacturing and planetary industry across multiple characters.</p>\n<p>It includes tools for manufacturing simulation and production chains, blueprint tracking, asset and industry-job visibility, and a colony planner for coordinating PI production across nearby systems.</p>\n<p>The app is still actively evolving, and I’d appreciate feedback from other industrialists and third-party developers.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://eve-horizon.com/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://eve-horizon.com/favicon.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://eve-horizon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">EVE Horizon</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/385;\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/0/a/e/0ae81c3b636a1a25f8f182fe84cea791a0fc7b18_2_690x385.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"334962\" width=\"690\" height=\"385\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://eve-horizon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">EVE Horizon — Your Personal EVE Online Copilot</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Track manufacturing jobs, plan blueprints, evaluate skills, and manage your characters and corp assets — all in one EVE Online copilot.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
