        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/vindicci/{size}/506755_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-08-10T22:53:16.638Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>Quick update on EVE Horizon since my last post - a handful of new tools and a lot of accuracy/reliability fixes based on feedback from actually running it against my own chars and other people feedback.</p>\n<p><strong>New: Colonies overview for PI</strong><br>\nA new rollup page across every character’s planetary colonies - extraction, production, and storage status at a glance, per-colony, with an honest “is this actually stale” signal instead of guessing. Includes a plan-vs-actual scorecard, still WIP as I realized CCP updates responses only when actual PI colony update made ingame.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/b/4/d/b4da483e5e44ae4432c9aeaf45fb146d090b9335.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/pNTBX4lBU0fFOhu15uhIgBj6bjf.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/4/d/b4da483e5e44ae4432c9aeaf45fb146d090b9335_2_690x205.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pNTBX4lBU0fFOhu15uhIgBj6bjf\" width=\"690\" height=\"205\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/4/d/b4da483e5e44ae4432c9aeaf45fb146d090b9335_2_690x205.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/4/d/b4da483e5e44ae4432c9aeaf45fb146d090b9335_2_1035x307.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/4/d/b4da483e5e44ae4432c9aeaf45fb146d090b9335_2_1380x410.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"242323\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">3786×1126 505 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>New in Manufacturing Sim: Sweep Hangar</strong><br>\nPick one or more of your hangars (personal or corp) and it subtracts what you already have on hand from the bill of materials - see exactly what’s still left to buy.</p>\n<p><strong>New in Manufacturing Sim: Save &amp; resume</strong><br>\nName and save a simulation (stations, jobs, ME/TE, everything) and reopen it later instead of losing your setup or juggling a giant URL.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/b/5/3/b5336ef10ef02d8faecbb151390e5f092e46e970.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/pQYCiakAhfDcFXP8Yq0g7617LVe.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/5/3/b5336ef10ef02d8faecbb151390e5f092e46e970_2_690x260.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pQYCiakAhfDcFXP8Yq0g7617LVe\" width=\"690\" height=\"260\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/5/3/b5336ef10ef02d8faecbb151390e5f092e46e970_2_690x260.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/5/3/b5336ef10ef02d8faecbb151390e5f092e46e970_2_1035x390.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/5/3/b5336ef10ef02d8faecbb151390e5f092e46e970_2_1380x520.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"222121\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">3724×1406 416 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Assets: real container hierarchy</strong><br>\nCorp and personal Assets now show exactly where an item sits - fitted to a ship slot, sitting in cargo, or in a hangar - including while searching</p>\n<p><strong>Under the hood</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed output volume showing a ship’s assembled size instead of its packaged (haulable) size</li>\n<li>“Sync ESI now” no longer syncs every account on the platform - just yours</li>\n<li>Fixed a data bug that was silently dropping some corp assets/blueprints during sync</li>\n<li>Assorted accuracy fixes: BPC valuation, industry job slot staleness, market turnover sync</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Still very much a work in progress - bug reports and feature ideas welcome, either here or through the in-app feedback widget.</p>",
