      {
        "id": 2917435,
        "name": "Vindicci",
        "username": "Vindicci",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/vindicci/{size}/506755_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-08-23T19:38:39.433Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>Another update on EVE Horizon! This batch is more about wiring the existing and new tools into a coherent story working together, plus a Blueprint/hangar integration that’s been the missing piece for a while.</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-2917435-new-market-restock-to-build-plan-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2917435-new-market-restock-to-build-plan-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>New: Market Restock to Build Plan</h2>\n<p>Market Restock makes it easy to turn shortages into a profit. Pick a trade hub away from Jita, create a watchlist of the items you want stocked there, and it will show you what’s actually running short and where the opportunities are. It’s useful for FW hubs, alliance markets, or any local market you want to keep supplied. Once you see the shortage list, you can either haul the items in from Jita or build them yourself. If you want to manufacture them, just click the <strong>Manufacture</strong> button and it will create a Build Plan with exactly what’s needed, with the depth of manufacture chain you want to spend time on, while keeping it linked back to the original restock plan.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/b/b/4/bb457852058a99587fe80d1bcf584791ce61a13c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/qIG7NrwAlBENWAsafef2IgpGrY8.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/b/4/bb457852058a99587fe80d1bcf584791ce61a13c_2_690x297.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qIG7NrwAlBENWAsafef2IgpGrY8\" width=\"690\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/b/4/bb457852058a99587fe80d1bcf584791ce61a13c_2_690x297.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/b/4/bb457852058a99587fe80d1bcf584791ce61a13c_2_1035x445.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/b/4/bb457852058a99587fe80d1bcf584791ce61a13c_2_1380x594.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"222121\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">3404×1470 340 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-2917435-new-in-build-plan-blueprints-panel-checked-against-your-hangar-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2917435-new-in-build-plan-blueprints-panel-checked-against-your-hangar-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>New in Build Plan: Blueprints panel, checked against your hangar</h2>\n<p>Build Plan now has a Blueprints panel that brings every blueprint in the plan into one place.  Only need to update it once and it applies everywhere that blueprint is used. You can also pick a hangar and the plan will check the BPCs and BPOs you actually own, showing whether each blueprint is <strong>Available</strong>, <strong>Need Hauling</strong> because it’s at another station, or <strong>Need BP</strong> because you don’t have one yet.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/b/8/1/b81de6210acc3182a7d4b685830178ac0e964904.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/qgLUABOZ6O0gQiyCGKIgHOwSo7y.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/8/1/b81de6210acc3182a7d4b685830178ac0e964904_2_690x196.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qgLUABOZ6O0gQiyCGKIgHOwSo7y\" width=\"690\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/8/1/b81de6210acc3182a7d4b685830178ac0e964904_2_690x196.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/8/1/b81de6210acc3182a7d4b685830178ac0e964904_2_1035x294.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/b/8/1/b81de6210acc3182a7d4b685830178ac0e964904_2_1380x392.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"252424\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">3384×964 323 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Still very much a work in progress - bug reports and feature ideas welcome, either here or through the in-app feedback widget.</p>",
